<title>USA: Polaris Industries Q4 sales up, net flat.</title>
<headline>Polaris Industries Q4 sales up, net flat.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polaris Industries Inc on Tuesday said sales in the fourth quarter rose about five percent, but earnings were flat in the period.</p>
<p>The company reported sales of $297.7 million, compared with $282.3 million in the same quarter of 1995. Net income was unchanged at $16.8 million.</p>
<p>Polaris said strong all-terrain vehicle (ATV) sales for all of 1996 helped offset slower snowmobile sales.</p>
<p>Polaris makes such recreational and utility vehicles as ATVs, snowmobiles and personal watercraft.</p>
<p>Its shares were down 3/4 Tuesday afternoon at 24-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
